  testprovider/ is a separate Go module used only by tests. It depends on
  github.com/hashicorp/terraform-plugin-framework and terraform-plugin-go
  (MPL-2.0), which are never linked into cmd/provider-bridge.

Recorded fixtures (testdata/)
  testdata/schemas and testdata/replies hold schemas and API replies
  recorded from provider binaries (integrations/github, stripe/stripe,
  hashicorp/null). They are data produced by those programs; no provider
  source code is included.
